The agent runtime (:agent:core, :agent:runtime) is a Kotlin re-implementation of the
architecture of DeepSeek Harness (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness):
its plugin model, session log, agent loop, tool pipeline, permission presets and compaction.
Tool names, event names and the compaction summary sections follow that project.

  DeepSeek Harness
  Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The image generation feature was designed after studying the behaviour of Local Dream
(https://github.com/xororz/local-dream, CC BY-NC 4.0). No source code, assets, models or
tooling from that project are included; the implementation is independent. Compatibility with
packages in its model layout (e.g. huggingface.co/xororz) was derived from the model files
themselves, not from its code.

